⍝ Make demo/before and demo/after: the sample component files, and a copy
⍝ with typical day-to-day edits, so there's something to compare.
⍝ Run (from the repo folder):  dyalog dcf-tools/make-demo.apls
⍝
⍝ Edits in after/:
⍝   customers.dcf  header text changed; Zoë's city and credit limit changed;
⍝                  a new customer appended
⍝   orders.dcf     order 1003 shipped (status, a quantity, a new field);
⍝                  order 1007 got an extra line; the last order dropped
⍝   settings.dcf   VAT changed; one month's sales corrected; two flags flipped
here←⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
src←here,'../sample-scripts/component-files/data/'
{}3 ⎕MKDIR¨here∘,¨'demo/before' 'demo/after'

Fresh←{⎕NEXISTS f←⍵,'.dcf':⎕NDELETE f ⋄ 0}
∇ to Copy name;s;d;n;first;next
  s←(src,name)⎕FSTIE 0
  {}Fresh to,name
  d←(to,name)⎕FCREATE 0
  (first next)←2↑⎕FSIZE s
  :For n :In (first-1)+⍳next-first
      {}(⎕FREAD s n)⎕FAPPEND d
  :EndFor
  ⎕FUNTIE s d
∇

:For f :In 'customers' 'orders' 'settings'
    (here,'demo/before/')Copy f
    (here,'demo/after/')Copy f
:EndFor

a←here,'demo/after/'
⍝ customers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
t←(a,'customers')⎕FTIE 0
'Customer master · version 2'⎕FREPLACE t 1
r←⎕FREAD t 5                         ⍝ customer 3, Zoë
r[3 4]←'Hamburg' 7500
r ⎕FREPLACE t 5
{}(11 'Nia' 'Nairobi' 3000 '2025-03-14')⎕FAPPEND t
⎕FUNTIE t

⍝ orders ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
t←(a,'orders')⎕FTIE 0
o←⎕FREAD t 3                         ⍝ order 1003
o.status←'shipped'
o.lines[1;2]←6
o.shipped←'2026-02-03'
o ⎕FREPLACE t 3
o←⎕FREAD t 7                         ⍝ order 1007
o.lines⍪←'Gadget' 1 19.99
o ⎕FREPLACE t 7
⎕FDROP t ¯1                          ⍝ drop the last order
⎕FUNTIE t

⍝ settings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
t←(a,'settings')⎕FTIE 0
kv←⎕FREAD t 1 ⋄ kv[2;2]←0.25 ⋄ kv ⎕FREPLACE t 1
m←⎕FREAD t 2 ⋄ m[3;12]←650 ⋄ m ⎕FREPLACE t 2
b←⎕FREAD t 3 ⋄ b[10 11]←~b[10 11] ⋄ b ⎕FREPLACE t 3
⎕FUNTIE t

⎕←'Made ',here,'demo/before and demo/after'
⎕←'Compare them:  python3 dcf-tools/dcf.py diff dcf-tools/demo/before dcf-tools/demo/after'
